+[discrete]
+==== Combine approximate kNN and a query
+
+You can perform 'hybrid retrieval' by providing both the
+<<search-api-knn, `knn` option>> and a <<request-body-search-query, `query`>>:
+
+[source,console]
+----
+POST image-index/_search
+{
+  "query": {
+    "match": {
+      "title": {
+        "query": "mountain lake",
+        "boost": 0.9
+      }
+    }
+  },
+  "knn": {
+    "field": "image-vector",
+    "query_vector": [54, 10, -2],
+    "k": 5,
+    "num_candidates": 50,
+    "boost": 0.1
+  },
